usage: test_multiturn_identity_e2e.py [-h] --source SOURCE --output OUTPUT
                                      [--case {all,reclaim,run,native,leader}]
                                      [--check-consistency]

Same runtime owner across receipt turns; reject different runtime owners. The
real CLI, socket, daemon handler, gates, Git and SQLite are exercised. Runtime
facts are controlled externally and are not real PTY/provider evidence.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source SOURCE
  --output OUTPUT
  --case {all,reclaim,run,native,leader}
  --check-consistency
